Transform the full previous extraction into a complete conceptual subject–relation–object model. Cover all accepted entities, properties and axioms, not a snippet. Avoid wrong inverse relations, unintended class-hierarchy cycles, inappropriate domains/ranges, and unjustified transitivity.

